OL,3,GNEWSAMural of The Fall singer
OL,4,Acelebrates 'life and legacy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mural of The Fall frontman Mark E
OL,7,FSmith has been unveiled in his home
OL,8,Fcity to celebrate his "life and
OL,9,Flegacy", a council has said.
OL,11,FThe ceramic and glass artwork of Smith,
OL,12,Fwho died in 2018, has been created by
OL,13,Fartist Mark Kennedy, who said he was a
OL,14,F"great friend" of the often-acerbic
OL,15,Fsinger-songwriter.
OL,17,FHe said the image of the musician
OL,18,Fholding a buttercup beneath his chin,
OL,19,Fwas based on a photograph he took of
OL,20,FSmith while the pair were walking
OL,21,Fthrough Manchester's Heaton Park.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
