OL,3,GNEWSAMural of The Fall singer
OL,4,Acelebrates 'life and legacy'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSalford mayor Paul Dennett said as part
OL,7,Fof the celebrations of the city's 100
OL,8,Fyears, it was "fitting that we have
OL,9,Fcreated this artwork to recognise a
OL,10,FSalford legend and cultural icon".
